const CAMERA_COLORS=[{value:'charging',label:'Goud / Gold'},{value:'waiting',label:'Blauw / Blue'},{value:'done',label:'Groen / Green'},{value:'planned',label:'Paars / Purple'},{value:'off',label:'Grijs / Gray'}];
